Hey, I have this approximately 5 year old PCI sound card from an HP Pavilion
8750c sitting around here that I recently pulled out of the computer when I
discovered that it seems to have absolutely no Linux support at all.  The
biggest chip on the board states that it is a Conexant Riptide RACC010.  I
was thinking about how useless this card was right now when it suddenly
occurred to me that maybe an ALSA developer could find this useful, however
unlikely that is.  So, if any developer is remotely interested in adding
support for this card, let me know and I will send it to you, no strings
attached.  Make sure to CC me as well as the list, I'm not a subscriber.

